Mom...

00:19:58.331 --> 00:20:01.743
100 points...

00:20:01.767 --> 00:20:03.879
My score...

00:20:03.903 --> 00:20:09.205
I had 90 points...

00:20:12.878 --> 00:20:19.443
Just 10 more and I would have been free...

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:46.989
He's... dead.

00:20:47.013 --> 00:20:47.589
"Pedestrians and Bicyclists Only"
He's... dead.

00:20:47.613 --> 00:20:49.980
"Pedestrians and Bicyclists Only"

00:21:06.799 --> 00:21:13.933
We all start out as pure and innocent babes

00:21:18.411 --> 00:21:25.442
Even if you taste the bitter fruit,
don't be discouraged, walk straight

00:21:29.989 --> 00:21:37.989
I know it's in the past, but the rain still stings

00:21:44.103 --> 00:21:46.348
I'm lonely as floating ice

00:21:46.372 --> 00:21:51.186
I kiss your thin finger

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:57.893
And remember you crying

00:21:57.917 --> 00:22:02.764
Even if this is the end

00:22:02.788 --> 00:22:07.669
I won't forget your last kiss

00:22:07.693 --> 00:22:15.693
I won't forget... I won't forget...

00:22:19.605 --> 00:22:27.605
I won't forget his kiss

00:22:36.722 --> 00:22:39.367
You probably think we're idiots, huh?

00:22:39.391 --> 00:22:43.538
Well, no big deal, but listen.
I'm running things around here now.

00:22:43.562 --> 00:22:47.008
You wanna get shot, Tetsuo?

00:22:47.032 --> 00:22:49.797
Next time: "Kato, You Wait Here.”
